WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.270
I really can't believe there's an inn out here.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:08.020
I mean, how far do you think we've walked from the station?

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.320
They should've had a shuttle pick us up. God!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.650
You two complain too much.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.280
Isn't this good exercise?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.950
For you!

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.700
This is like a full-length workout for us.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.210
I can see it!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.680
Wait, that's way too big!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:48.590
It doesn't matter when

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:59.490
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:04.690
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.170
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:10.910
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:15.660
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.520
I will always be your side

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:25.400
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:28.960
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.630
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.490
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:49.420
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:54.870
In the same world

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:10.100
Tenth Longsword

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:10.100
Fight to the Death at the Hot Springs

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.530
Welcome to our inn.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.210
What an amazing place.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.930
Ibuki-oneechan...

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.010
Can we really stay here?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.390
Of course.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.930
I won it, after all.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:50.850
You always work so hard at home, so try to relax for today.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.360
Okay!

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.440
There's no signal here...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.570
We're in the middle of nowhere.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:02.620
Ibuki-nee has been really lucky lately with the beach trip and now this.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:06.740
God only favors those with big breasts, anyway!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:07.660
If that's the case...

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.870
Buzz off!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.000
I didn't say anything.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.500
I should go for a stroll.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.840
Yoichi-san, are you going out?

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:24.010
I can't help but be bored inside, so I'm going to look around outside.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.890
What about you girls?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:30.100
We heard there's a huge hot spring here, so we're going to check it out.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.400
Not to mention we got all sweaty.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.520
Want to come, Yoichi-san?

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.480
N-No, uh-

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.480
What are you saying?

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.820
I didn't mean together.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:46.160
Yoichi-san, what were you thinking about?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.580
No, um...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.160
Oh yeah, I just remembered I have something to do!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.290
Sorry!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.670
Gosh...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:03.930
Chihaya-dono does this all the time, but she never fails to surprise me.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.190
Summer, huh?

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.190
What a lively squirrel.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.700
I wonder how everyone's doing.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.910
It's already been three months.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.460
Have I at least become a little stronger?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.130
Feels good, man...

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.930
I just took a bath...

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.770
Hey, is this place reserved?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.140
I didn't hear anything about that.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.020
I haven't seen any other guests.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.860
Neither have I, now that you mention it.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.490
Isn't that great? We can enjoy ourselves!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.780
This game is mine!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.080
I won!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.660
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, First Move:

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.830
Hurricane...

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.420
Smash!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.380
That was cheap.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.840
Oh my, I acted on my instincts...

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.050
We're here to have fun, so leave martial arts out of it.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.350
I'm sorry.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.510
Oh man, I give up.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.440
Man, this feels great!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.830
Oh, excuse me.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.380
Hey, I remember you...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.090
You're training to be a great samurai?

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.130
You're one of a kind.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.640
I am honored.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.890
However, I have yet to find the essence of a warrior,

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:17.230
and I'm always causing trouble for Ibuki-dono and the others.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:21.900
Oh, Ibuki-dono is the owner of the dojo I'm staying at.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.900
I see. So she's the one allowing your freeloading.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:32.160
Speaking of which, wouldn't a whole household of females hinder your training?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.490
To be honest, I've been distracted at times,

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.460
but they're all great people.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.750
They're all wonderful people who treat me as a part of their family,

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.960
so they don't hinder me at all.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.920
I see,

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.970
like family.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:55.180
However, a real family works together and helps each other.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:01.400
It seems to me like you only think of your own training.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.190
Have you thought about how helpful you are to them?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.650
If you can't help them at all,

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.910
aren't you simply dead weight to the Ikaruga family?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.660
An aquarium in the middle of the mountains...

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.710
This is ridiculous.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.420
That's huge!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.460
It looks good.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.970
Bon appétit!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.800
It's good, Yoichi-san!

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.310
Y-Yeah.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.930
I'll try some.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.650
It's truly delicious.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.110
That's great.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:50.780
We haven't had guests in a while, so the chefs went all out.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.570
Madam, are we really the only guests here?

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.870
Yes... lately we haven't had any guests.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:07.170
There's a cave behind our inn, and apparently it used to be a jail for criminals.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:13.130
Legend has it that the criminals died of dehydration and became ghosts.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.680
Recently, they've been coming out and causing trouble,

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:21.640
so thanks to that, we don't get any guests.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:27.060
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have brought that up in front of you.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.820
Ghosts? I don't believe that...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.120
Ma'am,

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:47.040
to show our gratitude for the food and rooms, I'll take care of those ghosts for you.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.380
But that's...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.840
This must be fate.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.970
Besides, I'd like to be of help to someone.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:55.720
My honored guest...

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.970
Then I'll go too.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.470
Ibuki-dono.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.930
Thank you both very much.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.320
Exorcising the ghosts?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.230
My sister and the samurai?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.360
Yeah.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.650
Is it all right for you to stay here?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.160
I don't care what they're going to do.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.280
Plus, ghosts don't exist!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.410
You're scared, aren't you?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.460
Ayame-nee, think about it.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.210
This is a perfect chance.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:31.840
Say that you're scared so you can hug him or hold his hand.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:36.300
Go for a more direct approach this time, Ayame-nee!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.930
That's ridiculous.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.100
Where are you going?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.510
To buy some juice.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.560
She's so simple.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.980
Time for me to follow her and get some ideas for my manga.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.070
Huh?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.070
I-I'm really sleepy...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.490
It's really effective.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.280
If I didn't have this antidote,

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.790
I'd be in a deep sleep right now.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:09.540
Gosh, Onii-sama, you can't even mix chemicals by yourself.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.340
You're so pathetic.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:15.050
What a great sister.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.050
You're cute, Sakon.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.130
Thanks to you, I can finally be with Ibuki-san...

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.220
Let's go.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.070
There's a strange presence here.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.570
Yes,

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.830
but for the sake of the inn lady, we have to do this.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:46.410
I'll protect you if anything happens.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.460
Yoichi-san...

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:49.870
Let's go!

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.130
O-Ouch...

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.380
Are you all right, Ibuki-dono?

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.680
Shoot, I lost her.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.560
Damn it, you ghosts!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:09.850
That's cheap!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.900
Ayame-dono?

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.070
Were you also curious about the ghosts?

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:19.990
I guess.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.030
But I got lost on the way...

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:24.200
I'm scared. I don't know what to do.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.870
But you're here now, so I'm happy.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.040
Thanks.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.170
Ayame-dono isn't acting like herself...

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.250
Samurai...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.170
Ayame-dono, what are you doing?

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.800
Oh, right, we have to find Ibuki-dono.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.560
Samurai, my sister is always with you.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.810
This is our chance to be alone together...

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.980
Do you understand?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.610
My heart is pounding...

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.160
Samurai...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.040
Look at me.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.880
This... is the real me.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.380
A-Ayame-dono?

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.920
Ow...

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.720
Yoichi-san?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.850
I lost him. What should I do?

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.140
Ibuki-san?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.270
Aren't you Ikaruga Ibuki-san?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.140
It's been a while, Ibuki-san.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.600
You are—

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.690
Who are you again?

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.490
You don't remember me?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.860
Have we met before?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.990
H-Have you forgotten about me?

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.740
We made a promise to each other when we were young!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:51.790
Pardon?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.170
H-How can this be?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:13:00.800
My plan... My flawlessly prepared plan...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.300
Um, more importantly...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.510
More importantly?!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.890
I've lost my friend.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.560
Have you seen him?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.560
Oh, are you talking about those two?

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:20.820
Hey, Samurai, please hold me tighter!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.610
It looks like she came after you.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.030
Are you okay, Ibuki-san?

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.950
If you don't mind, you can cry on my chest over here.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.080
Wow,

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.540
there actually are ghosts.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.580
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.960
Why are you saying that's a ghost?

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:46.630
My sister, Ayame, would never do something like that in public.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.760
B-But what about that guy?!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.720
Look at him! He's all turned on!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:57.440
Stop taking the form of Ayame-dono to trick me!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.520
You ghost!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.650
Ayame-dono is a very shy person.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.610
She would never do this!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.950
See? Yoichi-san understands.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.780
Besides! Besides...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.790
Ayame-dono's breasts aren't that big!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.250
Yoichi-san...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.750
Ibuki-dono, please be careful.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.380
I'm going to exorcise this ghost.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.350
Where am I?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.010
You're the worst, Yoichi-san.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.850
How can you tell girls apart by their bust size?!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.600
I'm sorry.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:45.070
However, I'm glad you don't think Ayame would do something like that.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.660
I see, it has to be Karasuma...

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.580
No matter what.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:54.990
You're the guy from...

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.250
So you're with the ghosts?

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.500
Do you know him, Yoichi-san?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.420
Sakon.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.210
Ibuki-dono!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.880
My body feels heavy.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.180
Even though you're a man, your body won't be able to move.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.810
Sakon's herbal skills are first class.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.640
I'll reintroduce myself.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.520
My name is Saginomiya Ukyo.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.860
I'm the leader of the Saginomiya Sapphire Style.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.860
I'm his sister, Sakon.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.360
Saginomiya Sapphire Style...

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.620
Karasuma Yoichi,

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.030
how dare you freeload off the Ikaruga family!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:40.410
You even tried to confuse Ibuki-san, my fiancée.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.710
You deserve to die.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.380
Fiancée?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:48.630
I don't know what technique you've used to make my dear Ibuki-san lose her memory,

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.630
but my love won't succumb to such cheap methods!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:56.140
Although I would love to kill you here, I'm a kind person, so I'll let you go.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.600
Go back to the mountains.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.600
An old-style samurai like you can't fit into this world.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.650
Let's go, Ibuki-san.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:08.070
Don't worry, I'll make you remember everything.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.620
Impossible! How can he move already?!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:18.990
I will never let Ibuki-dono be taken away by a liar like you!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.710
Interesting. Then why don't you go back to the inn?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.920
We'll wait for you there.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.080
Onii-sama!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.840
Don't worry, this way our preparations won't go to waste.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.440
The inn...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.690
Ibuki-dono...

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.310
Ayame-dono...

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:48.940
Chihaya-dono...

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.230
Kagome-dono...

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.030
I'm coming...

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.790
Well, it helps a little.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.250
Ayame-dono! Chihaya-dono!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.130
Damn it...

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.430
Thrusting Snake!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.680
Long time no see,

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.600
Hinagata-dono, what are you doing here?!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:29.860
Saginomiya-san said he'd give me another chance, so I came.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.070
Get ready, okay?

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.030
Senpai, stop running!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.030
What's wrong, Karasuma?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.870
This isn't like you.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:41.490
You coward.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.830
How dare you get a girl to be my opponent?!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.580
Don't worry, she's not your only opponent.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.920
Finish off Karasuma!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.800
The reward is as much money as you want!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.720
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Seventh Technique:

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.850
Tornado!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.440
Karasuma Yoichi,

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.530
it's great to see you again.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.160
You shall be food for these sharks.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.960
This board is amazing!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.710
Now, it's time for dinner.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.800
Here we go!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.140
Crap! Where did he go?!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.180
Uzumaru!

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.980
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Fourth Technique:

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.400
Storm!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.700
Is this really okay, Onii-sama?

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.580
Yes, this way Ibuki-san will be happy.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.050
Chihaya-dono! Kagome-dono!

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.400
Move,

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.200
he's mine.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.410
Karasuma Yoichi, we finally meet.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.910
Who are you?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:52.670
I am the successor of the Dark Crow Style, Nuezume Jinjyuro.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.170
I will send you to the afterlife.

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.170
Can you not move?

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.260
I'll finish you off in one blow.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:04.970
Brace yourself.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:05.720
Ukiha Divine Wind Style,

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.020
Sixth Technique: Winter Wind!

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.520
Huh?

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.520
Ayame-dono?

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.980
What are you doing, Samurai?

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:21.900
Ayame-dono,

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.240
Chihaya-dono and Kagome-dono are at the shelter.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.240
Please take them and run...

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.410
I'm already...

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.410
You idiot!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.500
Didn't you tell me to never give up?!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:37.840
Was that a lie,

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.340
Samurai?!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.340
Prepare to die!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.560
A warrior never eats his words.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.980
Thank you for saving me.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.060
I'll take care of the rest.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.450
You dumbass!

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.330
That bust size and that shyness...

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.290
It's the real Ayame-dono.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.170
Thank you for waiting.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.580
I shall take you on.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.550
Kagome! Kagome! Kagome!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:24.930
Ayame-oneechan?

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.430
You're okay!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.850
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Third Technique:

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.680
Peregrine!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:36.850
Fireworks?

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:47.360
Tell me the whereabouts of Ibuki-dono.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.120
Ibuki-dono!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.960
Ibuki-nee!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.210
Ibuki-oneechan!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.130
Sis!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.640
Who might you be?

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:27.780
I regret not realizing

00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:35.350
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:42.910
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:52.370
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:56.600
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:56.400 --> 00:23:00.360
Make me hesitate a little

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:07.350
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:11.220
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:15.070
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:17.420
You're not alone

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:21.750
Because I love you

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:26.360
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:29.920
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:37.380
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.600
Next Time!

00:23:42.600 --> 00:24:07.670
Eleventh Longsword

00:23:42.600 --> 00:24:07.670
Ibuki-san is Mine

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:45.860
It's so hard to live.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.530
I raised my son as a single man,

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:50.740
but I wonder where I went wrong.

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.820
He became a samurai with no knowledge of the world.

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:58.660
"I sent him off to the city thinking,
"I can't just leave things this way,"

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:02.000
but now he's become a complete wuss after being seduced by a woman.

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:05.880
I'm sorry.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:07.670
I didn't mean to be so blue.

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:10.670
Don't miss the next episode!

00:24:08.420 --> 00:24:10.670
Can I sing a song?
